Patchy is code review for arc, Phabricator's command line tool, as a
rewrite of Phorge's Differential in Elixir and Phoenix LiveView. It
keeps the Conduit API, so arc diff, arc patch, arc list and arc land
work against it unchanged, and the review pages: the revision page with
side by side and unified diffs, inline comments with drafts, review
actions, stacked revisions, a history, and the revision list grouped by
what each reviewer has to do next. Repository hosting, Herald, mail and
the rest of Phorge are left out.

It runs as one service on PostgreSQL. A post-receive hook closes
revisions when their commits land.
